OL,3,GNEWSAFamily to take murder victims'
OL,4,Aashes to Argentina
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stepmother of a teenager who
OL,7,Fmurdered three of his family members
OL,8,Fhas said she wants the victims' ashes
OL,9,Fto be scattered in Argentina.
OL,11,FNicholas Prosper killed his mother
OL,12,FJuliana Falcon, 48, his brother Kyle,
OL,13,F16, and 13-year-old sister Giselle, at
OL,14,Ftheir home in Luton.
OL,16,FReka Prosper said she and husband
OL,17,FRaymond Prosper wanted Falcon's ashes
OL,18,Frepatriated to her home country, where
OL,19,FFalcon lived until her 20s.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
